---
title: One open at a time
order: 1
---
<norn-accordion>
	<details name="faq" open>
		<summary>Does it need a script?</summary>
		<p>No. The browser opens and closes each section, and find-in-page opens a closed one.</p>
	</details>
	<details name="faq">
		<summary>Can two be open?</summary>
		<p>Not when they share a name. Leave the name off to let them open together.</p>
	</details>
	<details name="faq">
		<summary>Does it animate?</summary>
		<p>Where the browser can animate to an intrinsic size, unless motion is reduced.</p>
	</details>
</norn-accordion>
